# X is Brambleguard Captain's power as the ability resolves, not as it triggers (CR 608.2h). Turn 3 beginning of combat: the trigger
# targets the Memnite; Bot1 responds with Giant Growth on the Captain (5/6), so the trigger resolves with X = 5 and the Memnite
# becomes a 6/1 rather than a 3/1.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
Memnite
Brambleguard Captain
Giant Growth
Forest x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain x14

